Z||000000||1FST2M6||11-09-2001||02:19 PM||||ok heading to MSP (local speed shop) last night some guy in a blue fox body with Cobra Rs.. like everyone elses.. <P>I turned left off hwy 41 on to roswell... following me was my friend with his AE68 GTS. as lynds (wife) and i look to our right theres said stang merging in to the right lane.. he stabs the gas and kicks it side ways... he's all pointing and tauntin me by the first entrance of K-mart (150')... he pipe shoots me so i roll on the throttle he purges and we stand on it, i LEFT HIS @SS!! i had 3-4 cars on his him by the bridge (800') and i backed off.. his tires smoking and being all slow. he did the lame fly by and never stoped to chat... why is it ok for them to do the fly by and not acknowledge their opponent but it's not ok for them to have it done to them... (that make any sence) anywho i'm not bitter... just annoyed. why does tire smoke impress so many? it's a waste of time and tires. my moms 01 V6 Dakota will light em up... ooh BFD. <P>sooo how was your thursday night?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><P>------------------<BR>0-60 in 4.91<P> <A HREF="http://www.1fst2m6.com" TARGET=_blank>www.1fst2m6.com</A>  - underconstruction - but check it out anywho...||||reg||10
