Z||000004||GT Bastard||11-09-2001||07:31 PM||||Awesome kill Trav... Mine was less dramatic. Some kid in a heavily riced purple neon tried to start sh*t with the Starion whilst driving to my friends house.  Lowered, white 17in rims, and a Transformer sticker on the side!  He rides my ass and then tries to pass me full throttle.  WRONG... The Starion at 13psi leaves him like the wannabe he is.  Not too proud of that one, but hey it's almost winter and I need my racing fix!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/icare.jpg"> ||||reg||4
Z||000005||Shaun41178||11-09-2001||07:37 PM||||Alright Trav!!.  Nice kill.  The guy was probably pissed cause he thought he had you cause he has nitrous and thought it would be an easy kill.  hehe little did he know!!  Was probably too embarressed to slow and talk after trying to bully you.<P>I was never bullied with my 85 Gt and nitrous setup.  I envy you.  I had to go do the hunting.  Next Fiero I get I am going to put stickers all over it and a loud fart can just to attract a ton of attention so people will challenge me so I can blow their doors off.<P>It was always fun to race stangs.  Easy to kill.  I think I only lost to one Stang on the street in all the races I have had against stangs over the years.  Got tired of racing them actually.  Started goin for the big boys then.  My head got too big and I went up against a ol 79 Vette.  Well I blew the vette away but some 440 BB chevy was right behind me and blew my tires off after 80 mph.  Like I was standing still.  Kind of realized how slow my car was after that.<P>Again good kill and keep the stories coming.<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR>Shaun41178@hotmail.com<BR>PORN FOREVER!||||reg||1
Z||000006||Nashco||11-09-2001||07:49 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GT Bastard:<BR><B>Awesome kill Trav... Mine was less dramatic. Some kid in a heavily riced purple neon tried to start sh*t with the Starion whilst driving to my friends house.  Lowered, white 17in rims, and a Transformer sticker on the side!  He rides my ass and then tries to pass me full throttle.  WRONG... The Starion at 13psi leaves him like the wannabe he is.  Not too proud of that one, but hey it's almost winter and I need my racing fix!<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You've got a Mitsubishi Starion???  My friend back home has one, and he won't believe me it's a good car; I try to explain that a factory turbo large displacement four banger is a great starter, but he doesn't listen.  He thinks it looks too ghetto, and can't imagine it with fresh paint and better wheels.  You have pics?  I'd love to send some to him.  What mods have you done, if any?  PM me or hit me on here, I'd love to hear more, so I can tell my friend he's an ass <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Bryce<BR>88 GT||||reg||1
