Z||000009||GT Bastard||11-10-2001||01:26 AM||||Nashco, tell your friend to visit some starion/conquest sites online.  There's a lot of good ones, but try <A HREF="http://reality.halo.nu/starquest/narrow-media.html" TARGET=_blank>http://reality.halo.nu/starquest/narrow-media.html</A>  for starters.  Mine is just a clean narrow-body with new paint and a recent motor and turbo. Limited slip, oil cooler, and soon to be intercooled. I've found that they're very easy to work on and handle very well.  If he doesn't appreciate the car, pick it up for yourself!  ||||reg||1
