Z||000012||Slammed Fiero||11-10-2001||11:39 AM||||I find this hard to believe..my uncle larry's 3rd cousin Wilbul (who is Consequently larrys Dad)knows this guy who has a Mustang with NOS. He raced an Mclaren F1 and kicked it's ass. It will lift the tires for like 3 miles , he double clutches while drag racing , not like you granny shifitin Fiero drivers.<P>haha Sorry had too.<P>In other news , I went to the electronics store yesterday (future shop..bought out by best buy) In anycase I was in my moms 5.0 (auto 22,000 miles 1995) I got my ass handed to me by a guy in a new Cobra convert. I had him off the line , but at about 30mph he gave me a spankin.<P>has anyone looked at the exhaust manifolds on a 5.0ltr? There smaller than a fiero's! No wonder Every 5.0ltr I see for sale has headers on it. They look so restrictive, you can see kinks in the tubing from where they were bent. But since it's moms car were not allowed to play with it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> <P>JM  ||||reg||1
